If org.slf4j shows red: your Console output (11:10:52.895 [http-nio-8080-exec-1] DEBUG ...) looks like Logback, which includes SLF4J, so it should resolve. If it doesn't, add this to pom.xml and update Maven:

<dependency>
  <groupId>org.slf4j</groupId>
  <artifactId>slf4j-api</artifactId>
  <version>1.7.36</version>
</dependency>
